    <Figure src="heat-shield-exhaust-wrap.jpg" alt="Wrapped exhaust pipes" caption="Wrapped exhaust." />
    <Figure src="heat-shield-tunnel-underside.jpg" alt="DEI shielding in transmission tunnel from underneath" caption="Tunnel shielding from below." />
